keywords:
  - titration
  - gran method
  - schwartz method
  - potentiometric titration
  - equivalence point
  - analytical chemistry
  - green chemistry
  - uncertainty estimation
abstract: >
  GranTED is an open-source Python package for automated analysis of potentiometric titration data using the Gran and Schwartz methods. 
  It provides robust linear region detection, equivalence point calculation with uncertainty estimation, 
  and advanced diagnostic tools particularly useful for method development and validation in analytical chemistry.
